      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Dear Mei,

    I arrived by ferry this morning.

    Tomorrow I will carry
    cargo at

    the berth written on my pass.

    I found a bed on Dock Street,

    a
    short walk from the harbour.

    When wages come, I will send

    money home.

    Liang'
