  m_text: 'A JOB BECOMES A PLACE IN THE CITY

    Liang''s first wages paid for a
    bed near Dock Street. Cargo work tied

    his daily walk, shared lodging and
    letters home to the harbour.

    Migration changed the city through everyday
    lives like his.'
